Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.61,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honored that the alliance\Nbetween Owari and Mikawa...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.23,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're being far too formal.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.55,0:00:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to read the mood a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.93,0:00:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, Machiyo,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.46,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,did you make sure the soldiers got a share?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.74,0:00:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Everyone was overjoyed.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.70,0:00:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that you were a splendid ruler.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they, now?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.41,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking out the Imagawa \Nbarely got you any territory.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:29.34,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're keeping them sweet with food.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.74,0:00:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.37,0:00:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be paying {\i1}me{\i0} back another way, got it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.93,0:00:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you after?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.79,0:00:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The prettiest girl in Japan!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.85,0:00:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You watching me from up there,\N old man Toukichirou?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.54,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm on the path to becoming\Na ladies' man as we speak!
