Dialogue: 3,0:02:21.87,0:02:25.62,Ep Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,473)\bord2.25\3a&80&\fsp3\an7\blur3\b1\3c&H595959&\i0\fscx82\fscy90\pos(976.001,403)}Episode Five\NStrategy of\Nthe Genius Tactician
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.49,0:02:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We were already here!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.99,0:02:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fairly certain we're following the Kiso River.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.30,0:02:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.45,0:02:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shibata Katsuie's forces \Nare stuck in the swamp.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.93,0:02:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Them, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.62,0:02:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are strange piles of stones\Nthat are creating a labyrinth.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.68,0:02:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw something like this in a \N{\i1}Romance of the Three Kingdoms{\i0} manga.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Romance of the Three Kingdoms{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.75,0:02:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Stone Sentinel Maze!{http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stone_Sentinel_Maze}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongming's trap!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.47,0:02:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.01,0:03:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a trap devised by the \Nbrilliant strategist Zhuge Liang.{"Zhuge Kongming" is what she actually says, but it's more commonly written as Zhuge Liang}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.19,0:03:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to lure us into the swamp \Nand then flood it with river water.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Goemon, destroy the stone piles!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.55,0:03:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.91,0:03:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,These are what're keeping us \Ntrapped in the labyrinth, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's destroy them all!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.35,0:03:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone down there has come up with an interesting idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.26,0:03:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't flood the area?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.67,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.49,0:03:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My master prefers to avoid needless bloodshed.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.75,0:03:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, Oda advanced her forces to Mino,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.30,0:04:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but she lost every battle, with no \Nfurther success in her conquest.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.53,0:04:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so {\i1}frustrating!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.14,0:04:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we win?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.14,0:04:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's because{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.73,0:04:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a genius strategist in Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.19,0:04:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I, the Viper, could not match his wisdom.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.60,0:04:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been called the greatest strategist in history.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.41,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a trillion times smarter than you morons!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.53,0:04:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you picking a fight?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.02,0:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of any genius strategists.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.99,0:04:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.42,0:04:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was Mino's greatest secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.19,0:04:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.54,0:04:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.74,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Takenaka Hanbei!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.95,0:04:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody who plays Sengoku games knows him.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.05,0:04:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He has 98 points in INT, even without any item bonuses—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.67,0:04:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you knew, then you should've\N{\i1}told{\i0} me, you stupid monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.02,0:04:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I only remembered after we fought him!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.35,0:04:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The question now is how to defeat Mino!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.27,0:05:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.62,0:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only choice is to get \NTakenaka Hanbei on our side.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.09,0:05:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be faster to kill him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get all the \Ntop-ranked characters you can,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.60,0:05:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,or you're gonna run out of good people later.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.22,0:05:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's elementary in Sengoku games.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.31,0:05:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, Takenaka Hanbei is a man of honor.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.34,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine he'd join the Oda.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.74,0:05:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A man of honor, and a kind man.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.76,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all still alive, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.18,0:05:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.68,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He prefers to not shed blood needlessly.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.32,0:05:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, I think he'd get along with our Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.55,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's wasted on Yoshitatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.63,0:05:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Takenaka Hanbei \Nis here, Mino is safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.74,0:05:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A greater genius than even Count Dousan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.38,0:05:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Andou must be proud to be related to him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.26,0:05:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.66,0:05:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.23,0:06:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does Hanbei hide himself?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.67,0:06:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he dislike me, Yoshitatsu, that much?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.36,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.18,0:06:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a favorite of my father.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.24,0:06:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that Hanbei prefers to hide himself...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.97,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} am his lord now!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.02,0:06:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of retainer hides himself from his lord?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.54,0:06:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're right!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.99,0:06:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who's bringing Hanbei in?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd have to be me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.95,0:06:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to butt in again, Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.16,0:06:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my event.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.97,0:06:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Hideyoshi can win \NTakenaka Hanbei over!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.85,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Hideyoshi?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.37,0:06:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And more importantly,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.51,0:06:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,once I've brought him back,\Ndon't forget what you owe me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.35,0:06:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What I owe you?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.25,0:06:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The prettiest girl in Japan, what else?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.89,0:07:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not that cheap.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.24,0:07:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd have to take over Mino, at least.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.77,0:07:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's not happening.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.92,0:07:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you out, child.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.53,0:07:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have Mitsuhide as a guide.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.13,0:07:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Lookie here! No, you can't have it yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.29,0:07:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetfish! Sweetfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.68,0:07:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lookie, lookie. Okay, eat it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.73,0:07:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught an Inuchiyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you playing around?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.54,0:07:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Has your rotten brain \Nforgotten your job already?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.19,0:07:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.37,0:07:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you play Hideyoshi's route \Nin {\i1}Legends of the Civil Wars{\i0},{Not sure if this 'Civil Wars' should be changed. -GBF}{http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiko_Risshiden}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.86,0:07:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanbei joins you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.75,0:07:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then surely you already know
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,that Takenaka Hanbei is an onmyouji.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.93,0:07:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels haunted.{Original was too long for my tastes. See comment for original. 7:48 and 11:14 also changed to match. -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.99,0:07:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.04,0:07:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why nobody comes here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.15,0:07:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hanbei's an onmyouji? \NThat's news to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.07,0:08:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mitsuhide!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.11,0:08:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Andou Morinari!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.18,0:08:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were in \NOwari with Count Dousan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.59,0:08:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to convince \NHanbei to join you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.10,0:08:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.26,0:08:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't been getting along \Nwith Lord Yoshitatsu lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.68,0:08:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've gone with Count Dousan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's okay, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.29,0:08:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We are still retainers of \Nthe Saitou family of Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.39,0:08:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It will take more than \Nmere words to convince us.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Asai Nagamasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.39,0:08:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.63,0:08:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we're here for the same reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.27,0:08:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With Takenaka Hanbei at \Nmy side, Mino will fall.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.30,0:09:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a wedding invitation Asai Nagamasa \Nsent to all the counts.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.68,0:09:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That was called off!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.31,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}still{\i0} haven't given up?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.36,0:09:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I give her Mino, Nobuna \Nwon't be able to refuse.{Mino is a place, right? CR had 'bring her Mino', I think 'give her Mino' makes more sense. -GBF}{Sure. Mino as a gift for marriage.}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.58,0:09:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The marriage is as good as done.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.31,0:09:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you already...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give Nobuna to the likes of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.32,0:09:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it will be a showdown to see \Nwhich of us gets Takenaka Hanbei.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.82,0:09:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.44,0:09:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer you not decide that in my absence.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.15,0:09:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.27,0:09:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.58,0:09:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Takenaka Hanbei.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey of the Owari Oda clan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the young count of northern Oumi,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.78,0:09:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Asai Nagamasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know all about us.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.10,0:09:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll get right to the point. \NJoin the Oda—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You were going to have a showdown, yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.09,0:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these is the correct one.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.81,0:10:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The first to eat it wins.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.91,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, one of them is poisoned.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.58,0:10:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Poisoned?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.70,0:10:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't toy with us!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.17,0:10:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You get me, and Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.52,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A prize worth more than your life.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a good idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.61,0:10:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I promised her I wouldn't die!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.14,0:10:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Spicy!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.46,0:10:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad. That was a hot pepper bun.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.90,0:10:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.51,0:10:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A wasabi bun.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.21,0:10:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Two left.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.58,0:10:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gets it first?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.95,0:10:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing black!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, blue's the one!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a rock!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.54,0:11:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My teeth...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.09,0:11:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,None of them were correct!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.49,0:11:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What fools.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.40,0:11:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There {\i1}are{\i0} ghosts here!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked us!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.81,0:11:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault for being gullible.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.66,0:11:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.26,0:11:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you kill him?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters are supposed to be exterminated.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.21,0:11:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed the Saitou family's strategist.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.12,0:11:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If this becomes known, Nobuna's \Nreputation will be ruined.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad. Bring him back to life!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.13,0:11:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No response.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.77,0:11:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He already looks like a corpse.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just playing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. He's gone!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.85,0:11:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.11,0:11:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Search him out!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.48,0:11:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.33,0:12:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be mean to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.82,0:12:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.37,0:12:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm T-Takenaka Hanbei.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.61,0:12:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} Takenaka Hanbei?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.75,0:12:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Um, please don't be mean to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.27,0:12:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I won't. I'd {\i1}never{\i0} be mean to such a cute girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.33,0:12:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the Hanbei I looked up to
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.80,0:12:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,was just a little girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.55,0:12:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Zenki, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.43,0:12:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Hanbei's double, Zenki.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.08,0:12:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have revived.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.24,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Double?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.40,0:12:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.82,0:12:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My master, Takenaka Hanbei,\Nwas picked on because of her talents.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.45,0:12:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(424,0)}So, I took her place.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.87,0:12:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's also very shy,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.00,0:12:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and she has a habit of deliberately \Nangering people to see how they'll treat her.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.75,0:12:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be mean to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.53,0:13:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be mean.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.07,0:13:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me Hanbei!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.71,0:13:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you command it...{Fuck if I know what this line means, but 'But...' is too brief and simple. -GBF}{Yeah, it's right. The usual "Even if you say so..." (lol). alt. "We really can't."}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.76,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying you can't obey\Norders from the likes of me?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.51,0:13:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too, must think that I'm\N not half the man my father is!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.81,0:13:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Not at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.22,0:13:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Revolution has long been \Npart of Mino's history!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.38,0:13:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The strong take the land for themselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.29,0:13:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanbei plans to chase me from my\Nthrone and have Mino for himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.81,0:13:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yoshitatsu, what are you...?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.66,0:13:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll listen to Hanbei's excuses.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.40,0:13:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, you will go to prison.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.17,0:13:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Lord Yoshitatsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.37,0:13:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Every last one of you is plagued\N\hby the memory of Dousan's loss.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.03,0:13:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If Hanbei does not come, he will be executed.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.34,0:13:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A hostage?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.92,0:13:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really low.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.39,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're this serious...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.88,0:14:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be killed if you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.12,0:14:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Saitou Yoshitatsu thinking?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.58,0:14:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Hanbei, Mino is nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.39,0:14:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs a sharp blade.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.78,0:14:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But too sharp a blade puts him at risk.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.93,0:14:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshitatsu got cold feet.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans never change.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.43,0:14:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They only think about themselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.33,0:14:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Andou die.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.73,0:14:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If Andou dies, Hanbei will come to hate Yoshitatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.67,0:14:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She will attack Inabayama Castle\N to avenge her uncle.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mino will belong to me and Nobuna{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.39,0:14:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to do {\i1}anything{\i0} \Nthat would make a girl sad!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.65,0:14:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Andou is still safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.07,0:14:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.78,0:14:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Goemon.{Whenever I hear her name I think of Digimon. XD -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.55,0:14:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you and Goemon to rescue Andou.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.56,0:15:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.09,0:15:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy time with Hanbei.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.72,0:15:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to take her?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.91,0:15:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not kid Hanbei. The other one.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.34,0:15:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have Zenki take her place again.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.69,0:15:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'll go.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.71,0:15:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be dishonorable \Nto deceive Lord Yoshitatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.88,0:15:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.45,0:15:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I tell him the truth, that I'll never betray him,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.68,0:15:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll understand!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.73,0:15:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a very stupid person.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.48,0:15:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.53,0:15:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he will.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.24,0:15:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Let's go, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.74,0:15:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoshiharu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.73,0:15:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Takenaka Hanbei.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.88,0:15:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You are?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.82,0:15:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible! Hanbei is a man!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.52,0:15:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was using a double \Nfor reasons of my own.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.50,0:16:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This little girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.70,0:16:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You've caught us by surprise.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.10,0:16:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are a master strategist.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.79,0:16:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Um. My uncle...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.92,0:16:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When you are no longer suspected\N of treason, I will return him.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.90,0:16:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never betray you!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.28,0:16:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are just words!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.79,0:16:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.35,0:16:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is certainly unexpected.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.42,0:16:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly have no \Nintention of betraying me?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.04,0:16:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.42,0:16:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, why did you let the Oda go
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.32,0:16:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,despite having many \Nopportunities to destroy them?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.84,0:16:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want needless—
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.31,0:16:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the job of a strategist \Nto decimate the enemy!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.94,0:16:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.21,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.33,0:16:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can kill the enemy,\Nbut they'll just keep coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.97,0:16:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if the soldiers who run\Nspeak of how terrified they were?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.73,0:16:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mino has a genius strategist."
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.78,0:17:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"Attacking is useless."
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.08,0:17:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't everyone realize that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.13,0:17:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And you say that was Hanbei's intention?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.72,0:17:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She let the enemy live, and won.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.83,0:17:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she's a genius, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.34,0:17:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A strategist so powerful \Nis even more dangerous.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.69,0:17:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Takenaka Hanbei has no intention of rebelling.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.60,0:17:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She may not have the intention,\N but she {\i1}does{\i0} have the capability.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.18,0:17:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That is her crime.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.01,0:17:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Petty...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.41,0:17:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're far too petty!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.78,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.21,0:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A true lord uses the best men\Nhe can find to rule his country!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.67,0:17:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That was what Saitou Dousan did!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.69,0:17:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.73,0:17:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.59,0:17:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That crest... The Asai family?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.71,0:17:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. I am Asai Nagamasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.60,0:17:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the young Count of Oumi here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.04,0:17:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.53,0:18:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oda's Monkey was planning to\Nuse Hanbei to assassinate you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to stop them.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.19,0:18:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that's Nobuna's monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.94,0:18:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You treacherous piece of filth!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.40,0:18:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the one who brought it to this!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.44,0:18:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll just have to join with Mino\Nand take Nobuna for myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.52,0:18:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You—
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.98,0:18:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.91,0:18:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.84,0:18:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture Nagamasa alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the monkey.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.46,0:18:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.41,0:18:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for that little stunt.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.96,0:18:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Be silent!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.75,0:18:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Intruders!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.45,0:18:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sagara, I've saved Andou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.64,0:18:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Goemon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.63,0:18:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagamasa, we're leaving \Nwith Hanbei.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.28,0:18:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me orders!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.13,0:18:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to \Ndo with Hanbei?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.98,0:18:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't kill her.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.52,0:18:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A lord makes use of the \Nbest men he can find, yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.57,0:19:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have Hanbei be my concubine,\Nso that she doesn't get any ideas.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.22,0:19:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Concubine?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.78,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your power to surpass my father.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.54,0:19:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, we will conquer Japan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.29,0:19:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, {\i1}sweetie?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.89,0:19:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run away!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.93,0:19:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking back my master.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.15,0:19:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.25,0:19:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we just... capture Inabayama Castle?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is indeed what we've done.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.39,0:20:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanbei!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.15,0:20:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a bad fever.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.06,0:20:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This always happens when \NI've used too many spells.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.27,0:20:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanbei!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.23,0:20:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.08,0:20:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.34,0:20:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't treat her here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.53,0:20:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll abandon a castle you've captured?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.27,0:20:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't trade it for Hanbei!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.11,0:20:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Goemon, let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.75,0:20:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.15,0:20:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to do all this for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.67,0:20:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.76,0:20:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you'd just ignored me...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.74,0:20:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't want to get the \Ncastle like this, anyhow.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.37,0:20:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go back and get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.67,0:20:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the way Oda Nobuna likes, fair and square.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.91,0:20:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a very important person to you, isn't she?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.29,0:20:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.96,0:20:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's that important,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.68,0:20:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then you should lead the \NOda clan and conquer Japan...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.39,0:21:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,while hiding her somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.60,0:21:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not right.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.47,0:21:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to let her shine,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.15,0:21:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,like the moon in the night sky.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.73,0:21:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She shines when she's trying to conquer.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.65,0:21:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If she stops being herself, \Nthere's no point.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.09,0:21:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright light always casts a shadow.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.58,0:21:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And handling that is our job:
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.97,0:21:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,protecting her and letting her shine.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.34,0:21:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's just selfishness.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.50,0:21:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time you gain something, \Nyou'll lose something.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.82,0:21:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.54,0:21:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure I can.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.34,0:21:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just being childish.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.65,0:21:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me stay a child.{I liked the idea of this line, but maybe it's too liberal. The original is commented above. -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.83,0:21:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.47,0:21:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dummy, Mr. Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.65,0:21:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.43,0:22:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Too big of a dummy for me to leave you alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.29,0:22:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to protect you, and let you shine, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.15,0:22:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Takenaka Hanbei will serve not the Oda clan,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.30,0:22:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but Sagara Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.75,0:22:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, my lord?
